{
  "camel_example": "",
  "cmd_full_name": "milvusknowledgebase add-documents",
  "cmd_name": "add-documents",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Registers files that are uploaded to the knowledge base storage as knowledge base documents and automatically triggers parsing (chunking and embedding). Two import types are supported:\n\n`LOCAL_UPLOAD`: Works with the `GetKnowledgeBasePreSignedUrl` direct upload flow. This operation only registers the file and does not verify whether the file is actually uploaded. Therefore, you must complete the PUT upload before calling this operation.\n`OSS_IMPORT`: Imports files from an external OSS bucket. The operation creates an asynchronous import task and returns a `knowledge_import_task_id`. The system downloads and registers the files in the background.\n\nA maximum of 100 files can be registered in a single request",
  "description_zh": "把已上传到知识库存储的文件注册为知识库文档并自动触发解析（切片、embedding）。支持两类导入：\n\n`LOCAL_UPLOAD`：配合 `GetKnowledgeBasePreSignedUrl` 直传流程（本接口只注册，不再校验文件是否已真实上传，因此必须先完成 PUT 上传）；\n`OSS_IMPORT`：从外部 OSS 导入，接口先创建异步导入任务，返回 `knowledge_import_task_id`，由系统后台执行下载与注册。\n\n单次最多 100 个文件",
  "kebab_example": "",
